Are you a fan of car traffic games & street racing? Do you like planes and the sky? We have something new to play! Try a plane flying game with different missions, improve your flying skills and become a true professional in racing piloting in Jet Fighter Airplane Racing!

Jet Fighter Airplane Racing is an exhilarating game that takes you on a thrilling adventure in the world of aerial combat. In this game, you get to experience the sheer excitement of being an aviation fighter pilot, soaring through the skies in a powerful jet aircraft. Make professional maneuvers and get prizes for your racing achievements. 

Get a brand new experience with a high traffic racing on airplanes or fighter jets.  Maneuver among airliners, get the race score. Try not to get in a crash and get prizes & achievements!

Multiple modes are waiting for you! Air combat with airplanes, aviation traffic, pursuit of the plane and other armed forces games to discover. Moreover, colorful landscapes are here to make the airplane traffic racer gameplay even better.

Are you looking for exclusive aeroplanes or fighter jets in traffic racing? We have it too! Meet all kinds of planes:
• MiG-21 “Fishbed";
• McDonnell Douglas F-4 Phantom II;
• MiG-29 “Fulcrum”;
• F-16 Fighting Falcon;
• MiG-31 BM “Foxhound”;
• F-22 Raptor;
• SU-35 “Flanker-E”;
• SU-47 "Firkin";
• SU-57.

Become a skilled fighter pilot in the sky and get lots of adrenaline. Avoid the fly traffic & get the highest score in jet flying race games!

Jet Fighter Airplane Racing main features:
• Maneuver among airliners like a car traffic driver;
• Get prizes for your achievements in the fighter jet racing;
• Awesome 3D graphics for better experience;
• Atmospheric sound effects and music;
• Train your reaction to pass all high traffic missions;
• Addictive game process;
• Customize your jets to improve them in sky racing;
• And much more to find in Jet Fighter Airplane Racing!

Different modes won’t be boring! Choose your favorite jet, customize its features, score the highest points, be on the top and prove your air traffic piloting skills in aeroplanes gameplay! Earn coins to get the best modern airplanes in the aviation world and be on the top of the fly traffic racer game. 

Are you ready for the traffic airplane adventure? Take your seat, fasten your seatbelt and prepare for the sky airplanes & modern warplanes with high traffic racing with Jet Fighter Airplane Racing!

Do you want a truly unique IT gaming experience and classical 2D pixel design? Dev Tycoon is a business simulator for talented gamers, where you can create and develop different video games.

All developers start out in an old garage with no Hardware labs or employees and limited money for the first application. As creativity blooms and new applications are developed, the players can unlock additional options and modules, learn more about basic business and strategic ideas as well as various programming languages including Python, JavaScript, C++ and many others.

All the players will have an opportunity to move to new offices and hire staff, to open R&D and Hardware labs in order to create consoles and devices, to host major projects and unlock online shops similar to App Store etc.

Dev Tycoon gives you an incredible opportunity to be involved in the Mobile Games industry. Inspire yourself to create your own projects and connect your life with the IT industry.

Your to do’s:

- Learn different programming languages, including Python, JavaScript, C++ and many others;
- Research new technologies;
- Create custom game engines;
- Move into bigger offices;
- Unlock secret Hardware labs;
- Conduct industry changing projects;
- Unlock achievements and upgrade techniques.

… and become the best one!

Ready to become a hero and fight your way through the fire in the pixel dungeon? Become a firefighter and go on a survival adventure!

Firefighter is an exciting 3D RPG style pixel survival game, combined with RPG, shooter and action game elements. You have to fight fire monsters, survive and save the pixel world from fire! 

Test yourself and fight fire even offline. Upgrade your pixel gun and equipment as you progress through levels filled with dangerous monsters. Explore the depths of the pixel dungeon and fight fiery bosses as you fight for survival. Destroy all of them in this battle game!

In addition to the fact that you can play our pixel RPG shooter offline, you will find:
- no annoying ads;
- amazing retro pixel graphics;
- various levels and pixel gun;
- lots of fire monsters.

Join the firefighter in the pixel dungeon and survive in this exciting adventure. Become the hero the pixel world needs!

With 20 millions of downloads worldwide Real Drift Car Racing is the most realistic drift game on mobile devices, and yet easy to control and fun to play thanks to an innovative drift helper.
Get ready to drive high performance cars (turbo or naturally aspirated) and make them drift at high speed in tracks designed specifically for drift racing.
Improve your racing and drifting skills and earn virtual money to tune and customize your car.
Race to battle the world record of the leaderboard or just for fun in the freeride mode.

FEATURES
• The most realistic drift racing simulation on mobile devices;
• Customizable difficulty: from total novice to professional drifter;
• Extensive customization options: change body color, body vinyl, rims model, rims color and tire signature;
• Extensive tuning options: increase engine power, add a turbo, change handling settings (weight distribution, camber angle etc.), change gear ratios and shift speed;
• Photo mode to share your coolest drifts with your friends;
• Realistic simulation of all aspect (engine, drivetrain, tires, etc.) of the car;
• Specific engine sound for every car with turbo whistle and blow off valve;
• Backfire effects with sounds;
• Accurate points calculation: earn points by drifting at high speed, at high drift angle and, by light touching walls during a drift;
• Online and local leaderboard to challenge your friends and people all over the world;
• Big training track to improve your drifting and racing skills;
• Cool dubstep soundtrack by Liquid Stranger and Simplify Recordings.
• 35 racing tracks specifically designed for drifting;
• 19 different cars with specific and realistic setup;
• Challenging career mode with 38 championships with growing difficulty;


GAMEPLAY
• Accelerometer (gyroscope) or touch steering mode;
• Slider or touch throttle;
• Automatic or manual transmission;
• Metric or Imperial units of measurement;


ADVANCED POINTS SYSTEM
Points grow proportionally to drift angle, drift time and speed.
There are also 2 different points multiplier: "Drift Combo" multiplier and "Proximity" multiplier.
Drift Combo multiplier is increased by 1 whenever points reach a power of 2000 (1000, 2000,4000, 8000 etc.). If you change drift direction, points are added to Total Points Indicator (located in the top left of the screen) and reset. If points reach every multiple of 2000 again, Drift Combo is increased by 1 again. This works only if you keep drifting without too long interruptions between one drift and the other (less than 1 second), otherwise Drift Combo multiplier will be reset to 1.
Proximity multiplier is increased when you drift with the back of the car near a wall (less than 1.5 meters) proportionally to closeness. You'll notice this bonus with a slow motion effect and a text showing the multiplier factor.
If you hit anything you'll lose your partial points and all multipliers.

We will update and improve Real Drift constantly. Please rate and give your feedback for further improvement of the game.
